# TestBot example: Ctrl+wheel switches the ability-bar set (AbilityBarWheel).
# Needs AbilityBarWheel Enabled=1 with Trigger=modifier, Modifier=ctrl and
# HoldMs below 600. Load a save; every load starts on bar set 0.
# Format: docs/test-bot.md.

log start: waiting for the game world (load a save)
wait_world 600000
wait 2000
expect_bar_set 0

log hold Ctrl past HoldMs, one wheel notch up
mod ctrl
wait 600
wheel 1
wait 300
expect_bar_set 1

log one more notch flips back
wheel 1
wait 300
expect_bar_set 0
mod none

# The game's own switch (Left Ctrl, action 65) is hidden from the game while
# AbilityBarWheel runs with SuppressModifierKey=1, so test it only with the
# wheel plugin off:
#   key lctrl 30
#   wait 300
#   expect_bar_set 1

log done
